From b6e98df4ef1ae897a6d89e74ac92ca9e33c5b890 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 13:14:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/23] feat(web): show login method status in mall settings

Mall operators previously had no way to see whether WeChat or SMS phone
login was live. The new panel in mall settings reads the public
capability endpoint, shows each method's state, and lists the exact
environment variables that complete WeChat OAuth and the SMS gateway,
with a re-check button.
